---
title: Colour swatches and indicator bars
---

# Colour swatches

`\{% swatch /%}` draws a block colour bar that fills the available width — the
block sibling of the inline `\{% color %}`. Fill it solid with `color`, or
with a linear gradient via `gradient` (`"[Ndeg,] stop, stop, …"` — stops are
evenly spaced unless one carries an `NN%` position, and `transparent` is
allowed). `height` (points, default 6) and `radius` (default 2) size it. For a
small colour dot *inline*, reach for `\{% chip /%}` (below).

## Solid and gradient bars

A solid bar:

{% swatch color="#ff0000" /%}

A symmetric three-stop gradient (`90deg, #fd7e14, #ffffff, #fd7e14`):

{% swatch gradient="90deg, #fd7e14, #ffffff, #fd7e14" /%}

A taller vertical fade (`180deg`, `height=12`):

{% swatch gradient="180deg, #fd7e14, #fff3e0" height=12 /%}

A fade to transparent at 25 % (`#ff0000, transparent 25%`):

{% swatch gradient="90deg, #ff0000, transparent 25%" /%}

## Inline chips

`\{% chip /%}` drops a small colour dot into running text — the inline sibling
of `\{% swatch %}`. Fill it with `color`; `shape="square"` swaps the dot for a
square. It flows with the words: {% chip color="#ff0000" /%} stopped,
{% chip color="#00a000" /%} ready, {% chip color="#00b0b0" /%} driving, and a
{% chip color="#fd7e14" shape="square" /%} square variant.

It doubles as a compact inline legend — {% chip color="#ff0000" /%} Red ·
{% chip color="#00a000" /%} Green · {% chip color="#0000ff" /%} Blue — where a
full bar would be too heavy.

## Indicator key — swatch inside a grid

Put a `\{% swatch /%}` above a bold title and a short grey description in each
`\{% grid %}` cell, and the reflowing grid becomes a status / indicator key.
Solid colours and gradients (a "wavering" light shown as a gradient) sit side
by side. Render with `--assets-root examples` for consistency with the other
examples (no assets are needed here):

{% grid min=130 gap=16 %}
* {% swatch color="#ff0000" /%}

  **Red**

  {% color value="#6c757d" %}Emergency or Protective stop{% /color %}

* {% swatch color="#00fa00" /%}

  **Green**

  {% color value="#6c757d" %}Ready state{% /color %}

* {% swatch color="#00fafa" /%}

  **Cyan**

  {% color value="#6c757d" %}Drives to goal{% /color %}

* {% swatch gradient="90deg, #fd7e14, #ffffff, #fd7e14" /%}

  **Wavering orange**

  {% color value="#6c757d" %}Startup signal, before system is ready{% /color %}

* {% swatch gradient="90deg, #0000ff, #ffffff, #0000ff" /%}

  **Wavering blue**

  {% color value="#6c757d" %}Exploring{% /color %}

* {% swatch gradient="90deg, #ff0000, transparent 25%" /%}

  **Battery state of charge**

  {% color value="#6c757d" %}Charging at charger{% /color %}
{% /grid %}
